  "_id": "tg-jesus-christ-redeemer",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "I know that my redeemer liveth, Job 19:25. thy redeemer, the Holy One of Israel, Isa. 41:14 (43:14; 44:24; 48:17; 54:5; 59:20). our redeemer, the Lord of hosts is his name, Isa. 47:4. I the Lord am thy Saviour and thy Redeemer, Isa. 49:26 (60:16). he hath borne our griefs, and carried our sorrows, Isa. 53:4 (Mosiah 14:4). in his love … he redeemed them, Isa. 63:9. thou, O Lord, art our father, our redeemer, Isa. 63:16.",
